id: pm-rust-session-receipt-read-warning
title: Match the published diagnostic for unreadable session lock receipts
description: "With a directory at locks/session-state.lock, pm-cli 2026.11.18 readLockInfo reports lock_info_read_failed and acquireLockLease refuses with stale_lock_requires_override. Native session_lock_refusal returns stale-lock advice annotated lock_info_invalid_json. Preserve separate malformed, unreadable, and missing-receipt behavior when aligning the diagnostic."
